@startuml
title The Omagram window
start
:The project tree is on the left;
:The source is in the middle;
:The diagram is on the right;
:Ctrl+Alt+arrows moves between those areas;
if (the diagram needs a screen of its own?) then (detach)
  :Ctrl+Shift+N moves it to its own window;
  :Escape or closing that window brings it back;
else (keep it here)
  :Ctrl+B shows or hides the project tree;
endif
:Super+F fullscreens the whole window;
:The diagram can follow the colors of the Omarchy theme;
stop
@enduml
